### Kevalon ERP — Module 25: GST & Tax Master Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api
### Use VS Code REST Client extension to run these requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TAX MASTER ENDPOINTS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Seed Default GST Slabs (idempotent, seeded once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tax/seed-default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}"
}

### 2. Attempt to seed again (expect 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tax/seed-default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}"
}

### 3. List All Tax Rates for Company (sorted by ratePercent asc)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tax?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create Custom Tax Rate
POST {{baseUrl}}/tax
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "name": "Custom GST 15%",
  "ratePercent": 15,
  "taxCategory": "Taxable",
  "hsnSacApplicable": true
}

### 5. Create Duplicate Tax Rate Name (expect 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tax
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "name": "custom gst 15%",
  "ratePercent": 15,
  "taxCategory": "Taxable"
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GST VALIDATION & RETURNS ENDPOINTS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. Validate Fully Valid GSTIN (Format and Checksum pass)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gst/validate-gstin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gstin": "27GSPDE1234F1ZI"
}

### 7. Validate GSTIN with Correct Format but Wrong Checksum digit
POST {{baseUrl}}/gst/validate-gstin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gstin": "27GSPDE1234F1Z8"
}

### 8. Validate Malformed GSTIN Format (fails format regex)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gst/validate-gstin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gstin": "INVALID123"
}

### 9. Get GST Returns Summary (Placeholder shape)
GET {{baseUrl}}/gst/returns-summary?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Get GST Returns Summary with custom period
GET {{baseUrl}}/gst/returns-summary?companyId={{companyId}}&period=2026-08
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
